# Keep the repository text normalised to LF, with the one file that a Windows
# shell insists on: the Gradle wrapper. Without this, every line of
# android/gradlew.bat reads as trailing whitespace in `git diff --check`.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary assets: icons, splash art, store graphics, the Gradle wrapper jar.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jar binary
